{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/383188-as-you-dream-a-message-to-those-solars-who-lost-there-way","id":383188,"title":"As You Dream (A message to those solars who lost there way)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-27T09:07:03-08:00","id":383188,"title":"As You Dream (A message to those solars who lost there way)","content":"<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">As you dream one night you see a glimpse of the Usurpation.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Around you are those who slain you. Your body lay at your feet as you watch your life fade away. Your killers rejoice about their victory. From a nearby window there is a light and from that light a voice speaks out to you.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;They do not know the truth. They have won the battle but not the war. You are a part of me and I you. You are not defeated, you will be reborn and will rise up from the darkness. Your will is relentless and cannot be conquered . Now Breath once more for you are Exalted, You are Solar, You are Unconquerable.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like the Sun I am relentless even in death...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3293-rahod","name":"Rahod","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T19:27:09-08:00","id":383893,"title":"","content":"Pretty cool, but I don't think I would want to reveal the setting backstory to players in this way - I don't want anyone thinking that being a solar necessarily means the Sun wants you to go to war against the DBs. The PC's social context should do that, if anything does.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T20:06:37-08:00","id":383922,"title":"","content":"On the one hand, that is pretty inspiring, of spoiler-heavy. On the other... it fosters the exact &quot;I am infallible because my god is bigger than your god!&quot; attitude that made the Solars need to be killed in the first place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T21:26:00-08:00","id":383974,"title":"","content":"How can I not be conquered if I just died (ie, just got conquered)?<br /> <br /> Better yet.<br /> <br /> Imagine an Abyssal is the one dreaming --- and (like Infernals) not having gone through Lytek's office, they still see more fragments of their former Solar lives. So this dude is literally dreaming of a dream. So a Midnight Caste awakens all like...<br /> <br /> I DIE AND AM REBORN. I AM UNDYING, I RISE FROM DARKNESS. LIKE THE SUN PARCHES THE DESERT, I WILL BURN ALL LIFE.<br /> MY GLORIOUS CANCER AURA WILL SPREAD TRUTH TO THE DEAD. TWINKLE TWINKLE LITTLE STARS - I COME TO KILL YOU WHERE YOU ARE.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4831-redriotousram","name":"RedRiotousRam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4831_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T21:29:07-08:00","id":383978,"title":"","content":"Isn't the dream also making a judgment on the rightness of the Usurpation, and implying the Sun was against the whole thing? It seems like things like that should be left ambiguous, for the benefit of DB and Sid players if nothing else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T00:31:47-08:00","id":384036,"title":"","content":"And then they get a second dream revealing that their past incarnation was a total ass hat who probably deserved it and the character has to decide for themselves whether it is appropriate to seek vengeance against people (or more usually, their descendants) who were trying to protect Creation the only way they felt would assure it lived for another day.<br /> <br /> Or they don't get a second dream, whatever floats your boat. That is just how I think it should be handled.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T05:41:36-08:00","id":384150,"title":"","content":"FIRST DREAM, BEST DREAM.<br /> <br /> CLEARLY A PROPHECY, I MUST KILL THEM ALL BEFORE IT HAPPENS.<br /> <br /> I SHALL BE.... the DEATH SUN. *does the cha cha and maybe summons Ligier to learn his fancy pants dance*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4831-redriotousram","name":"RedRiotousRam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4831_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T07:33:37-08:00","id":384202,"title":"","content":"&quot;I dreamt of my hallowed ancestor, battered and bruised, among friends, some alive, some no more. Before him laid the king turned tyrant, he whose power drove him to madness, he who claimed he could not be bested in battle. He laid dead. He who shone gold like the Sun, he who made the earth tremble beneath his feet, dead. He made all believe he would always persevere - no longer.<br /> <br /> I saw my hallowed ancestor let out a sigh of relief, like a weight was pulled from his shoulders. He looked down upon his fallen foe, noted that his almighty patron had not saved him. And I heard his voice inside my heart. &quot;This night, we conquered the unconquerable and delivered justice to the lawgiver.&quot;, he said. &quot;It has become clear that these men and women are a danger to this world, and it has been proven that they are not omnipotent. Though our brothers and sisters may perish, though many will fall before the so-called God-Kings, it is our duty to never let this happen again. Our progeny will keep up the fight as long as time itself holds, or watch Creation shatter at the hands of the golden ones.&quot;<br /> <br /> And then I awoke, and in my heart I knew why I fought.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Turns out these things can go both ways.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4672-hog-of-war","name":"Hog of War","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T15:38:58-08:00","id":384558,"title":"","content":"Last night I dreamed of Manderley...<br /> <br /> There was Manderley, my Manderley, secretive and silent as it had always been, the grey stone shimmery in my dream, the mullioned windows reflecting the lawns and the terrace. Time could not wreck the perfect symmetry of those walls, not the site itself, a jewel in the hollow of a hand.<br /> <br /> Manderley, my manse besides the sea, from which I governed the coast for many leagues. Once I sent fleets to destroy pirates and other pests, before I turned to other pursuits.<br /> <br /> The storm was dark, save for flashes of lightning; the sea heaved and crashed, the foam topping the cliff. And yet a glorious ray of sunlight shone eternal upon Manderley.<br /> <br /> No, it rose <b>from</b> Manderley! and I knew I would be reborn, and where. Perhaps I would do better this time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like my Avatar? Courtesy of<span style=\"color:#0000FF\"> Jen</span>! : <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Anybody want their characters to be experimented on ? </span>post 98<br /> <i>An Exalt is never unarmed.</i>","edited":{"userid":4018,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4018-l-het-esh","user":"L'het'esh","date":". 01-29-2015, 10:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4018-l-het-esh","name":"L'het'esh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4018_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"521"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T03:39:53-08:00","id":384895,"title":"","content":"I like to incorporate first age glimpses in the dreams of my players, but never full explain what's going on, as dreams are confusing things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/393-godjaw","name":"Godjaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar393_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"665"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T12:20:40-08:00","id":385450,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Godjaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/383188-as-you-dream-a-message-to-those-solars-who-lost-there-way?p=384895#post384895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like to incorporate first age glimpses in the dreams of my players, but never full explain what's going on, as dreams are confusing things.</div> </div> </div> </div>I like to throw in non-sensical elements. &quot;Across the parade grounds you see your forces, a hundred thousand strong. And also some hippos in tutus dancing to a brass band lead by a trombone playing camel.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><i>Later in the campaign...</i><br /> <br /> Solar: *Bursts though door* &quot;Kejak! Prepare to face justice!&quot;<br /> Me: The chair slowly turns around, to reveal...<br /> Solar: *GASP!* I knew it! Everyone said I was crazy!<br /> Camel: Muhahaha. Yes, I suppose it is time to end the little ruse. Kejak was a convienent scapegoat, and I must say that you've played your part admirably as well!&quot;</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Have you ever read a Coik post before, man? lol<br /> -Holden<br /> <br />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/338-coik","name":"Coik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar338_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"611"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}